WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.939
Need a copy of an invoice? Easy. Here's how to grab it.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.623
Head over to Finance, then pop into Customer invoices.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.223
Spot the invoice you're after, and hit the little printer icon.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.176
Now click Print, save as PDF, and save it wherever you like.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.393
And that's it! Your invoice is all yours.

